DUSD::burn
├── given contract is paused
│   └── it should revert with IsPaused
├── given caller is not authorized burner
│   └── it should revert with DUSDNotAuthorized
├── given caller is authorized burner
│   ├── when from address is zero address
│   │   └── it should revert with ERC20InvalidSender
│   ├── when amount exceeds balance
│   │   └── it should revert with ERC20InsufficientBalance
│   ├── when amount is zero
│   │   └── it should burn zero tokens successfully
│   ├── when amount is valid and within balance
│   │   ├── it should burn the specified amount from the account
│   │   ├── it should decrease total supply by the amount
│   │   ├── it should decrease account balance by the amount
│   │   └── it should emit Transfer event from account to zero address
│   └── when burning entire balance
│       └── it should burn all tokens and set balance to zero
